# test_v2130.ins — v2.13.0: Studio Bridge v2 + iOS Export
#
# NOTE: All Studio Bridge v2 and iOS export tests remain in test_v2130.py
# because they test Python-level infrastructure: _InputManager emulation,
# _GameProcess subprocess management, Bridge HTTP RPC (start_game,
# stop_game, game_status, set_node_prop, add_node, remove_node,
# get_live_scene, set_breakpoints, debug_stop, emulate_input), and
# build_ios export scaffolding. These involve subprocess management,
# HTTP servers, file I/O, and TOML parsing that cannot be expressed
# as InScript execution tests.
#
# See test_v2130.py for the full test suite.
